{% doc %}
  Product page buy form (TE-4 AC2 markup, AC3 option and quantity, AC4, AC6,
  AC9, AC15, AC16, NFR-7; ADR 0008 items 1, 3, 4). Reads the global
  `product`. Works without JavaScript (NFR-4): the form buys
  current_variant; changing options needs JS (product.md §17).

  current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant, so the first
  available variant loads by default, and ?variant= deep links and
  ?option_values= partial requests render that variant's hidden id, stock
  state and button. No loop over the product's variant list, no variant
  list JSON, no select listing variants (up to 2048 variants).

  Variant picker: snippets/product-variant-picker (partial product-options,
  custom element product-variant-picker, BE TE-4-R2-BE2) sits outside the
  form so its radios are never submitted. Not rendered when
  product.has_only_default_variant or product.variants_count == 1 (AC9: one
  variant with its own option values is still no choice). Hidden without JS.

  variant_exists: false when the selected option values form no variant
  (the selected value of the first option has no value.variant; same rule as
  the picker's "unavailable" state). current_variant then falls back to the
  first available variant, but the stock line and button say Unavailable,
  the button is disabled and a hint explains it (variant-picker §6.5).

  Partials (names must match the JS, ADR 0008 item 3):
  - product-installments: {{ form | payment_terms }}.
  - product-selling-plans: radios name=selling_plan with prices from
    current_variant.selling_plan_allocations; One-time purchase (empty value)
    unless product.requires_selling_plan; product.selected_selling_plan is
    preselected. Empty when the product has no selling plan groups.
  - product-buy-buttons: the hidden input name=id (current_variant, the only
    id the form sends, ADR 0008 item 4), script[data-selected-variant] (one
    variant, or null when variant_exists is false), stock line
    (in_stock / sold_out / unavailable) with a "Checking availability…" line
    for the loading state, the unavailable hint and the submit button
    (disabled + Sold out / Unavailable label when it cannot be bought).
  - product-pickup: only when current_variant.requires_shipping and at least
    one store availability has pick_up_enabled; first location + pick up time,
    other locations in a details element.

  Loading state (AC15, variant-picker §6, CSS in assets/product.css): JS sets
  aria-busy="true" on every [data-variant-busy] region (stock here, price in
  blocks/product-info, price in blocks/product-sticky-bar) and
  aria-disabled="true" on the add buttons; it never adds a spinner to them.

  {{ form | payment_button }} renders when the show_dynamic_checkout setting
  is on, outside every partial (Shopify's script mounts the buttons, a
  refresh would drop them). Only the unbranded button and the "more payment
  options" link take theme tokens (contrast AA); branded wallet buttons keep
  their own colors (AC4).

  Gift card (product.gift_card?): checkbox
  properties[__shopify_send_gift_card_to_customer] plus Recipient email,
  Recipient name, Message (200 characters) and Send on (today to +90 days).
  The fields show through CSS :has(:checked); assets/product-form.js (BE
  ES1-T67) toggles disabled and adds properties[__shopify_offset].
  Gift card errors (product-shopify-features §6, foundation §12; markup ES1-T545,
  check ES1-T554): sentence #<input id>Error under Recipient email (hidden;
  data-label-required, data-label-invalid; text in [data-form-error-text]) and
  under Send on (date range from min / max). The recipient fieldset counts as a
  form of 2+ fields, so on Add to cart with errors the script clones
  template[data-form-summary-template] (data-label-1..2 "Check {n} field(s)",
  [data-form-summary-title], li[data-form-summary-for="<input id>"] hidden,
  link text [data-form-error-text]) into product-form-error and focuses it.

  Root custom element product-form (CSS display: block) with data hooks:
  data-product-id, data-product-url, data-cart-add-url, data-cart-url,
  data-cart-type (settings.cart_type from TE-5, default drawer),
  data-label-add, data-label-added (status text after add, ES1-T84),
  data-label-sold-out, data-label-unavailable. Live regions:
  product-form-status (role status) and product-form-error (role alert,
  .form-message--error, tabindex -1, display none while empty: no whitespace
  inside), empty on load, both direct children of product-form. The picker has its own
  role=alert per option, so assets/product-form.js reads only direct children
  (:scope>[role=status], :scope>[role=alert]); keep these two out of nested
  wrappers. JS sets aria-busy on the root
  while loading.

  Test hooks: product-form, product-variant-picker, product-option (fieldset),
  product-option-value (label wrapping the radio), product-form-variant-id,
  product-selected-variant, product-stock, product-inventory,
  product-inventory-checking, product-form-unavailable, product-quantity,
  product-selling-plans, product-selling-plan (label wrapping the radio),
  product-gift-card-toggle (checkbox), product-gift-card-email,
  product-gift-card-name, product-gift-card-message,
  product-gift-card-send-on, product-gift-card-error-email,
  product-gift-card-error-send-on, product-gift-card-summary-template,
  product-gift-card-error-link, product-form-add, product-payment-button,
  product-installments, product-pickup, product-pickup-details,
  product-form-status, product-form-error.

  Empty state: no product (block used outside the product template) → a
  hint in the theme editor, nothing on the storefront.

  Self-contained: callers must leave the body empty.

  @example
  {% block 'container', id: 'product-main' %}
    <div class="product__details">
      {% block 'product-form' %}{% endblock %}
    </div>
  {% endblock %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- if product == blank -%}
  {%- if request.design_mode -%}
    <div class="product-form product-form--placeholder" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
      {{ 'blocks.product_form.placeholder' | t }}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
    assign form_id = 'product-form-' | append: product.id
    assign cart_type = settings.cart_type | default: 'drawer'

    assign label_add = 'blocks.product_form.add_to_cart' | t
    assign label_added = 'blocks.product_form.added_to_cart' | t
    assign label_sold_out = 'blocks.product_form.sold_out' | t
    assign label_unavailable = 'blocks.product_form.unavailable' | t

    assign has_variant_choice = true
    if product.has_only_default_variant or product.variants_count == 1
      assign has_variant_choice = false
    endif

    # Tổ hợp đang chọn không tạo thành biến thể (ADR 0008, quy tắc ES1-T253: value.variant rỗng)
    assign variant_exists = true
    if has_variant_choice
      for option in product.options_with_values limit: 1
        for value in option.values
          if value.selected and value.variant == blank
            assign variant_exists = false
          endif
        endfor
      endfor
    endif

    assign today = 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%d'
    assign send_on_max = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 7776000 | date: '%Y-%m-%d'

    if product.gift_card?
      assign gift_optional = 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.optional' | t
      assign gift_error_email_required = 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.error_email_required' | t
      assign gift_error_email = 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.error_email' | t
      assign send_on_start = today | date: format: 'abbreviated_date'
      assign send_on_end = send_on_max | date: format: 'abbreviated_date'
      assign gift_error_send_on = 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.error_send_on' | t: start: send_on_start, end: send_on_end
      assign gift_summary_1 = 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.error_summary' | t: count: 1
      assign gift_summary_2 = 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.error_summary' | t: count: 2
    endif
  -%}

  <product-form
    class="product-form"
    data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
    data-product-url="{{ product.url }}"
    data-cart-add-url="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}"
    data-cart-url="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
    data-cart-type="{{ cart_type | escape }}"
    data-label-add="{{ label_add | escape }}"
    data-label-added="{{ label_added | escape }}"
    data-label-sold-out="{{ label_sold_out | escape }}"
    data-label-unavailable="{{ label_unavailable | escape }}"
    data-testid="product-form"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    {%- if has_variant_choice -%}
      {%- render 'product-variant-picker', product: product, form_id: form_id -%}
      <script src="{{ 'product-variant-picker.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- form 'product', product, id: form_id, class: 'product-form__form' -%}
      {% partial 'product-installments' %}
        <div class="product-form__installments" data-testid="product-installments">
          {{- form | payment_terms -}}
        </div>
      {% endpartial %}

      {% partial 'product-selling-plans' %}
        {%- if product.selling_plan_groups.size > 0 -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign selected_plan = product.selected_selling_plan
            assign plan_preselected = false
            if selected_plan != blank
              assign plan_preselected = true
            endif
          -%}
          <fieldset class="product-selling-plans" data-testid="product-selling-plans">
            <legend class="product-form__label">{{ 'blocks.product_form.purchase_options' | t }}</legend>
            <div class="product-selling-plans__list">
              {%- unless product.requires_selling_plan -%}
                <label class="product-selling-plan" data-testid="product-selling-plan">
                  <input
                    class="product-selling-plan__input"
                    type="radio"
                    name="selling_plan"
                    value=""
                    {% unless plan_preselected %}
                      checked
                    {% endunless %}
                  >
                  <span class="product-selling-plan__name">{{ 'blocks.product_form.one_time_purchase' | t }}</span>
                  <span class="product-selling-plan__price">{{ current_variant.price | money }}</span>
                </label>
                {%- assign plan_preselected = true -%}
              {%- endunless -%}

              {%- for group in product.selling_plan_groups -%}
                {%- if product.selling_plan_groups.size > 1 -%}
                  <p class="product-selling-plans__group">{{ group.name | escape }}</p>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- for plan in group.selling_plans -%}
                  {%- for allocation in current_variant.selling_plan_allocations -%}
                    {%- if allocation.selling_plan.id == plan.id -%}
                      {%- liquid
                        assign plan_checked = false
                        if selected_plan != blank and selected_plan.id == plan.id
                          assign plan_checked = true
                        elsif plan_preselected == false
                          assign plan_checked = true
                          assign plan_preselected = true
                        endif
                      -%}
                      <label class="product-selling-plan" data-testid="product-selling-plan">
                        <input
                          class="product-selling-plan__input"
                          type="radio"
                          name="selling_plan"
                          value="{{ plan.id }}"
                          {% if plan_checked %}
                            checked
                          {% endif %}
                        >
                        <span class="product-selling-plan__name">{{ plan.name | escape }}</span>
                        <span class="product-selling-plan__price">
                          {%- if allocation.compare_at_price > allocation.price -%}
                            <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'products.price.sale_price' | t }}</span>
                            {{ allocation.price | money }}
                            <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'products.price.regular_price' | t }}</span>
                            <s class="price__compare">{{ allocation.compare_at_price | money }}</s>
                          {%- else -%}
                            {{ allocation.price | money }}
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </span>
                      </label>
                      {%- break -%}
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endfor -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        {%- endif -%}
      {% endpartial %}

      <div class="product-form__field">
        <label class="product-form__label" for="{{ form_id }}-quantity">
          {{- 'blocks.product_form.quantity' | t -}}
        </label>
        <input
          id="{{ form_id }}-quantity"
          class="product-form__input product-form__quantity"
          type="number"
          name="quantity"
          min="1"
          value="1"
          inputmode="numeric"
          data-testid="product-quantity"
        >
      </div>

      {%- if product.gift_card? -%}
        <div class="product-gift-card">
          <label class="product-gift-card__toggle" for="{{ form_id }}-gift-toggle">
            <input
              id="{{ form_id }}-gift-toggle"
              class="product-gift-card__checkbox"
              type="checkbox"
              name="properties[__shopify_send_gift_card_to_customer]"
              value="on"
              data-testid="product-gift-card-toggle"
            >
            {{ 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.toggle' | t }}
          </label>

          <fieldset class="product-gift-card__fields">
            <legend class="visually-hidden">{{ 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.legend' | t }}</legend>

            <div class="product-form__field">
              <label class="product-form__label" for="{{ form_id }}-gift-email">
                {{- 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.email' | t -}}
              </label>
              <input
                id="{{ form_id }}-gift-email"
                class="product-form__input"
                type="email"
                name="properties[Recipient email]"
                autocomplete="off"
                data-testid="product-gift-card-email"
              >
              <p
                id="{{ form_id }}-gift-emailError"
                class="product-form__field-error"
                data-label-required="{{ gift_error_email_required | escape }}"
                data-label-invalid="{{ gift_error_email | escape }}"
                data-testid="product-gift-card-error-email"
                hidden
              >
                {%- render 'status-icon', name: 'error' -%}
                <span data-form-error-text>{{ gift_error_email_required }}</span>
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="product-form__field">
              <label class="product-form__label" for="{{ form_id }}-gift-name">
                {{- 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.name' | t }}
                <span class="product-form__optional">{{ gift_optional }}</span>
              </label>
              <input
                id="{{ form_id }}-gift-name"
                class="product-form__input"
                type="text"
                name="properties[Recipient name]"
                autocomplete="off"
                data-testid="product-gift-card-name"
              >
            </div>

            <div class="product-form__field">
              <label class="product-form__label" for="{{ form_id }}-gift-message">
                {{- 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.message' | t }}
                <span class="product-form__optional">{{ gift_optional }}</span>
              </label>
              <textarea
                id="{{ form_id }}-gift-message"
                class="product-form__input product-form__textarea"
                name="properties[Message]"
                rows="4"
                maxlength="200"
                aria-describedby="{{ form_id }}-gift-message-hint"
                data-testid="product-gift-card-message"
              ></textarea>
              <p id="{{ form_id }}-gift-message-hint" class="product-form__hint">
                {{- 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.characters_left' | t: count: 200 -}}
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="product-form__field">
              <label class="product-form__label" for="{{ form_id }}-gift-send-on">
                {{- 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.send_on' | t }}
                <span class="product-form__optional">{{ gift_optional }}</span>
              </label>
              <input
                id="{{ form_id }}-gift-send-on"
                class="product-form__input"
                type="date"
                name="properties[Send on]"
                min="{{ today }}"
                max="{{ send_on_max }}"
                pattern="\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}"
                aria-describedby="{{ form_id }}-gift-send-on-hint"
                data-testid="product-gift-card-send-on"
              >
              <p id="{{ form_id }}-gift-send-on-hint" class="product-form__hint">
                {{- 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.send_on_hint' | t: days: 90 -}}
              </p>
              <p
                id="{{ form_id }}-gift-send-onError"
                class="product-form__field-error"
                data-testid="product-gift-card-error-send-on"
                hidden
              >
                {%- render 'status-icon', name: 'error' -%}
                <span data-form-error-text>{{ gift_error_send_on }}</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {% partial 'product-buy-buttons' %}
        {%- liquid
          assign can_buy = false
          if variant_exists == false
            assign stock_state = 'unavailable'
            assign stock_label = label_unavailable
          elsif current_variant.available
            assign stock_state = 'in_stock'
            assign stock_label = 'blocks.product_form.in_stock' | t
            assign can_buy = true
          else
            assign stock_state = 'sold_out'
            assign stock_label = label_sold_out
          endif
          assign unavailable_id = form_id | append: '-unavailable'
        -%}
        <input
          type="hidden"
          name="id"
          value="{{ current_variant.id }}"
          data-testid="product-form-variant-id"
        >
        {%- render 'selected-variant-data', variant: current_variant, exists: variant_exists -%}
        <div class="product-form__buy-buttons">
          <div class="product-form__stock" data-variant-busy data-testid="product-stock">
            <p class="product-form__inventory" data-state="{{ stock_state }}" data-testid="product-inventory">
              {{- stock_label -}}
            </p>
            <p class="product-form__checking" data-testid="product-inventory-checking">
              <span class="spinner product-form__checking-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              {{- 'products.variant.checking' | t -}}
            </p>
            {%- unless variant_exists -%}
              <p id="{{ unavailable_id }}" class="product-form__hint" data-testid="product-form-unavailable">
                {{- 'products.variant.combination_unavailable' | t -}}
              </p>
            {%- endunless -%}
          </div>
          <button
            class="button product-form__add"
            type="submit"
            name="add"
            {% unless can_buy %}
              disabled
            {% endunless %}
            {% unless variant_exists %}
              aria-describedby="{{ unavailable_id }}"
            {% endunless %}
            data-testid="product-form-add"
          >
            <span class="product-form__add-label">
              {%- if can_buy -%}
                {{- label_add -}}
              {%- else -%}
                {{- stock_label -}}
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
          </button>
        </div>
      {% endpartial %}

      {%- if block.settings.show_dynamic_checkout -%}
        <div class="product-form__payment-button" data-testid="product-payment-button">
          {{- form | payment_button -}}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endform -%}

    {% partial 'product-pickup' %}
      {%- liquid
        assign pickup_locations = current_variant.store_availabilities | where: 'pick_up_enabled'
      -%}
      {%- if current_variant.requires_shipping and pickup_locations.size > 0 -%}
        {%- assign first_location = pickup_locations.first -%}
        {%- assign first_name = first_location.location.name | escape -%}
        <div class="product-pickup" data-testid="product-pickup">
          <p class="product-pickup__status" data-available="{{ first_location.available }}">
            {%- if first_location.available -%}
              {{- 'blocks.product_form.pickup.available_at' | t: location: first_name -}}
            {%- else -%}
              {{- 'blocks.product_form.pickup.unavailable_at' | t: location: first_name -}}
            {%- endif -%}
          </p>
          {%- if first_location.available and first_location.pick_up_time != blank -%}
            <p class="product-pickup__time">{{ first_location.pick_up_time | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if pickup_locations.size > 1 -%}
            <details class="product-pickup__details" data-testid="product-pickup-details">
              <summary class="product-pickup__summary">{{ 'blocks.product_form.pickup.other_locations' | t }}</summary>
              <ul class="product-pickup__list" role="list">
                {%- for availability in pickup_locations offset: 1 -%}
                  <li class="product-pickup__location">
                    <p class="product-pickup__name">{{ availability.location.name | escape }}</p>
                    <p class="product-pickup__time">
                      {%- if availability.available -%}
                        {{- 'blocks.product_form.pickup.available' | t -}}
                        {%- if availability.pick_up_time != blank %}, {{ availability.pick_up_time | escape }}{% endif -%}
                      {%- else -%}
                        {{- 'blocks.product_form.pickup.unavailable' | t -}}
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </p>
                    <div class="product-pickup__address">{{ availability.location.address | format_address }}</div>
                  </li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            </details>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    {% endpartial %}

    <div class="product-form__status visually-hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-testid="product-form-status"></div>
    <div
      class="product-form__error form-message form-message--error"
      role="alert"
      tabindex="-1"
      data-testid="product-form-error"
    ></div>
    {%- if product.gift_card? -%}
      <template
        data-form-summary-template
        data-label-1="{{ gift_summary_1 | escape }}"
        data-label-2="{{ gift_summary_2 | escape }}"
        data-testid="product-gift-card-summary-template"
      >
        {%- render 'status-icon', name: 'error' -%}
        <div class="form-message__body">
          <strong class="form-message__title" data-form-summary-title></strong>
          <ul class="form-message__list" role="list">
            <li data-form-summary-for="{{ form_id }}-gift-email" hidden>
              <a href="#{{ form_id }}-gift-email" data-form-error-text data-testid="product-gift-card-error-link">
                {{- gift_error_email_required -}}
              </a>
            </li>
            <li data-form-summary-for="{{ form_id }}-gift-send-on" hidden>
              <a href="#{{ form_id }}-gift-send-on" data-form-error-text data-testid="product-gift-card-error-link">
                {{- gift_error_send_on -}}
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </template>
    {%- endif -%}
    <script src="{{ 'product-form.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
  </product-form>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.product_form",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_dynamic_checkout",
      "label": "t:labels.show_dynamic_checkout",
      "info": "t:info.show_dynamic_checkout",
      "default": true
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
